{"slug": "haute-living-celebrates-daddy-yankee-together-with-florida-yachts-international-and-diageo", "title": "Haute Living Celebrates Daddy Yankee Together With Florida Yachts International And Diageo", "description": "Florida Yachts International, alongside Haute Living and Diageo, was thrilled to pay tribute to Daddy Yankee at Zuma in Miami, Florida. The ...", "date": "2023-06-12", "category": "Blog", "image": "https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2023/06/FYIYachs_HauteLiving_DaddyYankee-115.jpg", "html": "<p>Florida Yachts International, alongside Haute Living and Diageo, was thrilled to pay tribute to Daddy Yankee at Zuma in Miami, Florida. The exclusive cover star dinner hosted by Haute Living Miami for Daddy Yankee was a remarkable and unforgettable event. Honoring his iconic cover shot taken at the Loan Depot Park home of the Florida Marlins added a profound sense of significance to the occasion. It celebrated his incredible journey from shattered baseball dreams to becoming the founder of reggaeton music.</p><p>DIAGEO, with its exceptional brands Buchanan’s Whisky and Tequila Don Julio, recognized Daddy Yankee’s remarkable achievements in music and culture as a proud 200 %er, representing his Puerto Rican and American heritage. The team at DIAGEO highlighted Daddy Yankee’s unwavering pride in his cultural roots and his passionate dedication to his music and entertainment career, which serves as an inspiration to break barriers and stay true to oneself. The evening commenced with delightful custom cocktails, featuring Don Julio Reposado Tequila and Buchanan’s Pineapple Whisky, creating an atmosphere of excitement. Haute Living’s Senior Vice President, April Donelson, and Florida Yachts International’s CEO, Ralph Navarro, expressed their heartfelt gratitude to Daddy Yankee for his awe-inspiring achievements in music, setting the stage for an unforgettable night.</p><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2023/06/FYIYachs-Daddy-Yankee.jpg\" ta